message: 'To cite package "drillingdata" in publications use:'
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'drillingdata: Borehole Drilling and Construction Data – Malawi, 2018 - 2024'
version: 1.0.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17543305
abstract: This dataset captures detailed information on borehole drilling and construction
  activities conducted across selected sites in Malawi in 2018. Data were collected
  using the mWater digital platform, documenting each stage of groundwater development,
  from site selection and hydrogeological studies to drilling operations, borehole
  design, and post-construction assessments.
